{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39081","headline":"题宛陵北楼 · 郑准","name":"题宛陵北楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨来风静绿芜藓，凭着朱阑思浩然。\n人语独耕烧後岭，鸟飞斜没望中烟。\n松梢半露藏云寺，滩势横流出浦船。\n若遣谢宣城不死，必应吟尽夕阳川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑准","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39081.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39081","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}